   "y": 8400
  },
  {
   "id": "r167",
   "kind": "text",
   "src": "R17.6.1.2 (ASME B1.1):  A_se = (π/4)(d_a − 0,9743/n_t)², n_t hilos/pulgada (1″-8UNC)",
