   "src": "A_se := pi/4 * (d_a - 0.9743/n_t * 2.54 * cm)^2 = cm^2",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 8544
  },
  {
   "id": "r170",
   "kind": "text",
   "src": "ASTM F1554 Gr. 55: f_y = 55 ksi, f_uta = 75 ksi · topes de 17.6.1.2: 1,9·f_y y 860 MPa",
