   "y": 9168
  },
  {
   "id": "r182",
   "kind": "text",
   "src": "17.8.3 (hormigón, ζ = 5/3): N_n,cg = el menor de N_cbg, N_ag y N_sbg (el pullout es",
   "x": 40,
